Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 04:45:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Stop model selection from debiting or switching paid
 providers.

Selection records a relative weight only. An unavailable or unsupported model is refused, and a second paid provider runs only with an explicit same-workspace authorization.
